<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile sells 31,288 lbs of ferro-columbium.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile sells 31,288 lbs of ferro-columbium.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense National Stockpile Center said it sold 31,288 pounds (contained columbium) of ferro-columbium to H.C. Starck for an approximate market value of $213,000.</p>
<p>The next ferro-columbium offer is on April 8.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
